    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7328" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάπτωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>falling back:</i> metaph., <i>slackness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1406.8
			</span></i>; of machines, <i>recoil,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				68.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				82.13
			</span></i>; of style, <i>lifelessness,</i> Eust.ad <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				69
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>reclining at meals,</i> Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				187
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				203
			</span></i>; generally, <i>lying down,</i> in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				10.11
			</span></i>.</div>
